<view class="page stats-page">
 <view class="card"><view class="two"><view class="field"><view class="label">开始日期</view><picker mode="date" value="{{range.start}}" data-key="start" bindchange="input"><view class="select">{{range.start}}</view></picker></view><view class="field"><view class="label">结束日期</view><picker mode="date" value="{{range.end}}" data-key="end" bindchange="input"><view class="select">{{range.end}}</view></picker></view></view><view class="row capacity"><text class="small grow">每位专家单次计划接诊人数</text><input value="{{range.capacity}}" type="number" data-key="capacity" bindinput="input"/><text>人</text></view><view class="spacer"></view><button class="primary" bindtap="refresh" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">更新统计</button></view>
 <view wx:if="{{dirty}}" class="notice">条件已修改，请更新统计后查看或导出。</view><view class="section-title section">所选日期统计</view><view class="ledger-summary"><view class="ledger-row"><text>归档病历数</text><view><text class="ledger-number">{{stats.total.visits}}</text><text class="small"> 份</text></view></view><view class="ledger-row"><text>转诊资料包</text><view><text class="ledger-number">{{stats.total.referrals}}</text><text class="small"> 份</text></view></view><view class="ledger-row"><text>专家服务记录</text><view><text class="ledger-number">{{stats.total.experts}}</text><text class="small"> 次</text></view></view><view class="ledger-row"><text>其中随访记录</text><view><text class="ledger-number">{{stats.total.followups}}</text><text class="small"> 次</text></view></view></view><view class="meta">累计建档 {{stats.total.residents}} 位居民</view>
 <view class="between section"><text class="section-title">各村服务台账</text><text class="small">{{stats.rows.length}} 个村</text></view><view class="village-sheet" wx:for="{{stats.rows}}" wx:key="village"><view class="between"><view class="section-title">{{item.village}}</view><text class="small">建档 {{item.residents}} 人</text></view><view class="village-numbers"><view><text>{{item.visits}}</text><view>归档病历</view></view><view><text>{{item.referrals}}</text><view>转诊资料</view></view><view><text>{{item.experts}}</text><view>专家服务</view></view><view><text>{{item.followups}}</text><view>其中随访</view></view></view><view class="bar"><view class="bar-fill" style="width:{{item.percent}}%"></view></view><view class="divider"></view><view class="between"><view><view class="label">符合参考条件的居民 {{item.priority}} 人</view><view class="small">专家人数参考： {{item.suggestedExperts}} 位专家</view></view><text class="badge warn">人工确认</text></view></view>
 <view class="empty" wx:if="{{!stats.rows.length && !busy}}"><view>暂无各村台账</view><view>首次归档病历后自动汇总</view></view><view class="notice">专家人数参考按符合条件的居民数与每位专家预计接诊人数计算，向上取整，最终由村医确认。重点居民按最新归档病历筛选：疾病种类不少于2、需复核异常或至少90天未就诊，满足任一条件；不受所选日期限制。转诊资料包数量不代表实际转诊人数。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="export" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || dirty}}">导出 Excel 统计表</button><view class="meta">Excel 包含统计口径、各村汇总和逐条服务台账。</view></view>
